        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Problems visible in the schema:&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;1. Denormalisation — NAME / TYPE / DOSE / PRICE are copied into sales, purchase, history_sales.&#xa;2. No primary key on 5 tables (sales, history_sales, login, inbox, message_history).&#xa;3. drugs.COMPANY_NAME has NO foreign key (only purchase.COMPANY_NAME does).&#xa;4. Dates stored as varchar and parsed in code with split(&quot;-&quot;).&#xa;5. Passwords stored in plain text (users.PASSWORD varchar(20)).&#xa;6. Duplicate tables inbox = message_history.&#xa;7. Dead structure — expiry table is never queried.&#xa;8. latin1 encoding instead of utf8mb4." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="550" x="500" y="800" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
